plete"}],"content":"Unknown. Rocks, Plate of Stones and Rocks, Unknown. Ceramic, stones, and rock, 3/4 x 9 inches. Georgia O'Keeffe Museum. Gift of Juan and Anna Marie Hamilton. © Unknown. [2000.4.16]","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"A collection of various round, smooth and flat rocks and stones displayed on a green ceramic plate. The rocks and stones vary in size from  4 1/4 inches in diameter to 1/2 inch in diameter and range in color from black, brown, gray and purple-red . One of the rocks is a sandstone concretion - a rock nestled in a hollowed out rock ( like an egg in a bird nest).","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Holding Institution","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_instituion"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe Museum","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Medium and Dimensions","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_medium_dims"}],"content":"Ceramic, stones, and rock, 3/4 x 9 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}